            "sid": "JDG 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu Yerubayali, diyi Gideyona, niantu ejima adiŋiyi nawu amenekeli budidi, hiyakuya nakutuŋa chilombu kwishima daHarodi; chilombu chawaMidiyani chadiŋi kumbadi yakabeta kakuchimunswa, kumpidi yaMora muchinekineki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamwilili Gideyona nindi, Antu wudi nawu ananvulili, hinatweshikuyinkawu aMidiyanuku, aIsarela akenza kadinka wanta nakwilanawu, Nadamwini nachikasa chamami aweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu yaŋa, kayihoshiawa antu neyi, Yowu natiyi woma, yowu wukuzaala, afuntumu kwindi, afumi kunu kumpidi yaGileyadi. Kwafuntili antu makombakaji makumi ayedi namakombakaji ayedi, kwasheli makombakaji ikumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamwilili Gideyona, nindi, Antu achidi amavulu; yikunku mwishikumeji, diku kunukukwesekelawu. Mwakela, yoyenowu nukukulejanami iwu wakaya nindi, diyi wakaya nindi. Yenowu nukukulejanami yeniwu hiwakaya ninduku, yenowu hakayaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi wayikunkumwishili antu ejima kumeji. Yehova hakumwila Gideyona nindi, Ejima akukabula meji nedimi dawu, neyi chakabulaŋa kawa, wakayisha hakankawawu; ejima akufukama hamanuŋu nakunwa, niwena kanka wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyichinda akabwili nakusha chikasa kukanwa, ashikili mumayala makulakaji asatu; hakwila antu anashali ejima afukamini hamanuŋu nakunwa meji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NiGideyona ninkulakaji yawamayala adiŋiyi nawu, ashika nikushikakunsa yachilombu hohakutachika kuhembawu atulama amukachi kawufuku, mwomu mukuyishaku atulama katataka tuhu; emba nikwimba mpuja jawu, afumpani masaba adiŋuwu nawu mumakasawu pwashi, pwashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yendu yejima yisatu hiyakwimba mpùŋa, afumpani masaba, yimunyi ayi kwata mumakasa achimunswa, mpùŋa kwata mumakasa achidiilu kulonda kwimba; ela nikwila nawu, Mpoku yakabali yaYehova niyaGideyona, wo-o! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weji-Tna wawu emeni, iwu nahindi, iwu nahindi, kuchilombu kwi-ndo; niluntulwejima hilukutemoka, antu aGideyona adikuwili, ayitemwisha nikuyitemwisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpuŋa jina makulakaji asatu ajiimbili, Yehova wayiluwaŋesheliiwu nakutapa mukwawu, iwu nakutapa mukwawu, luntu lwejima; luntu lwatemukili nakushika kuBetishita, kutwala kuZerere, kwokuŋinza yaAbeli Mehola, kwakwihi naTabata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala aIsarela adipompesheli, niamuNafwatali, niamuAsheri, niamuManase mwejima, hiyakuyihaŋa aMidiyani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideyona watemesheli antemesha mwituŋa daEfweremi damapidi dejima, nakuyila nindi, Yikunkumukilenu aMidiyani muyiketwŋi kukaloŋa, nikuBetabara, nikuYodana. Nochu amayala amuEfweremi ejima adipompesheli, ajikililili kukaloŋa ndo nikuBetabara, nikuYodana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayikwatili atulamba awaMidiyani, wowu aOrebi naZeyebi, mwayedi wawu; Orebi amujahila kwilola daOrebi, Zeyebi amujahila kuwukamwinu wavinyu waZeyebi, ayihaŋaŋa tuhu aMidiyani; nyitu yawaOrebi naZeyebi amutweleleli Gideyona kwishinadi daYodana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
